          "description": "The ‘90s called… and we answered. In this video, Nicole shows you how to make a cosmo with ice, vodka, triple sec, lime juice, and cranberry juice. All you have to do is combine the ingredients in a cocktail shaker, then give it a really good shake since this drink has to be served ice cold. This classic cosmopolitan cocktail tastes just as good as it looks – yes, it’s strong, but it’s also delightfully juicy and tangy. If you’re too embarrassed to order a cosmo when you’re out, simply try making one at home with this easy recipe instead.",
