              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used fresh lime juice and \"diet\" cranberry juice. This is delicious. I tripled it only because I wanted a bigger drink. My husband keeps sneaking sips."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michael Arnold"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We typically make 'Big Cosmos' - 4 oz. vodka, 2 oz. Grand Marnier, Triple Sec (or similar orange liqueur) 2 oz. lime juice, 6 -8 oz. cranberry cocktail - to taste. Pour everything over 4-6 ice cubes in a large tall glass and garnish with lime wedges/slices.",
            "datePublished": "2021-02-05T21:40:49.607Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CleverSalad1070"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The classic Cosmopolitan is made with Absolut Citron, Cointreau (not triple sec), and yes...cranberry juice. Shake well and garnish with fresh lime. It's the Citron and lime combo + Cointreau which had less sugar than triple sec that makes this the all original created by my friend Toby Cecchini at the Odean Bar in NYC",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-19T19:29:13.618Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mech88"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My(wife's) tastes tend to gravitate towards more sweet and less alcohol. She's essentially a non-drinker.\n\n I add about 1/4 oz simple syrup (equal parts water and sugar) and beef up cranberry juice a bit. \n\n1.5 oz vodka, 1/2 oz Triple Sec, 1 oz cranberry juice, 1/2 oz fresh lime juice, 1/4 oz simple syrup.",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-31T23:00:00.463Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Andie1040"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used Absolut Citron and a full ounce of cranberry juice which makes a perfect balance for me!",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-16T21:43:52.663Z"
          },
          {
